#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:5
#: a044dfc2034b45d3b7b66ba192b2d7d4
msgid "U-Blox F9P Firmware Update"
msgstr "U-Blox F9P 固件更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:7
#: e10fd1ae0d504368944d1168997ce557
msgid ""
"The U-Blox F9 GPS is an L1/L2 RTK GPS that can provide high accuracy "
"positioning and can also be used for :ref:`GPS-for-Yaw <common-gps-for-"
"yaw>`.  This documents how to upgrade the firmware on the GPS."
msgstr ""
"U-Blox F9 GPS 是一款 L1/L2 RTK GPS，可提供高精度定位，也可用于 :ref:`GPS 偏航 <common-gps-for-"
"yaw>`。本文档介绍如何升级 GPS 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:10
#: 40f890bbc11e470cbc6efc52d2a42a00
msgid "Firmware Upgrade Procedure"
msgstr "固件升级步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:12
#: d61fa783728d4563a0f5508b9d8dfbd4
msgid ""
"`Download u-center from u-blox.com "
"<https://www.u-blox.com/en/product/u-center>`__ and install on your PC "
"(Windows only)"
msgstr ""
"`从 u-blox.com 下载 u-center <https://www.u-blox.com/en/product/u-center>`__ "
"并安装到 PC（仅支持 Windows）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:13
#: 5ecb33f6ec8c4f4bb11cc9fd8c478c55
msgid ""
"Open the `u-Blox ZED-F9P website "
"<https://www.u-blox.com/en/product/zed-f9p-module?legacy=Current#Documentation-&-resources>`__"
msgstr ""
"打开 `u-Blox ZED-F9P 网站 "
"<https://www.u-blox.com/en/product/zed-f9p-module?legacy=Current#Documentation-&-resources>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:14
#: 5ed71d5238864dbc979d4c8679e75f64
msgid "Scroll down and click on the \"Documentation & resources\" button"
msgstr "向下滚动并点击「文档与资源」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:15
#: fd507e130d9447e09ee1cf3615ef3a7a
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the \"Firmware Update\" section and download the latest "
"firmware (\"ZED-F9P L1/L2 HPG 1.50 firmware\" as of Jul 2024)"
msgstr "向下滚动至「固件更新」部分，下载最新固件（截至 2024 年 7 月为「ZED-F9P L1/L2 HPG 1.50 固件」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:16
#: 1d59b5635e5440b49d6c79a0de6f5086
msgid "Connect the GPS to your PC using a USB cable"
msgstr "使用 USB 线将 GPS 连接到 PC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:17
#: 3e141f1a2f204a27951e25cda63e4725
msgid "Open u-center, select the COM port and connect"
msgstr "打开 u-center，选择 COM 口并连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:23
#: 5be3d822132b4685a9ef01e0bf3d47b3
msgid ""
"Check the GPS's current firmware version by selecting View, Messages View, "
"UBX, MON, VER"
msgstr "通过 View > Messages View > UBX > MON > VER 查看 GPS 当前固件版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:29
#: e343635b1ca74d00a4044d81698fd894
msgid ""
"If the version is lower than the latest (especially if lower than 1.13) then"
" upgrade the firmware"
msgstr "如果版本低于最新版（尤其是低于 1.13），则需升级固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:31
#: 83bfc46153f444f1aa8b53ae7145b561
msgid "Select Tools, Firmware Update"
msgstr "选择 Tools > Firmware Update"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:32
#: 8efcf7286e8c4289aae74a73d670111c
msgid "The Firmware image field should be the .bin file downloaded above"
msgstr "固件镜像字段应选择上面下载的 .bin 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:33
#: dff5a04a04014ff4b8b605ef99b6f28c
msgid ""
"Check the \"Use this baudrate for update\" checkbox and select 115200 from "
"the drop-down"
msgstr "勾选「使用此波特率进行更新」复选框并从下拉菜单中选择 115200"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:34
#: c49625d41797455f886642bdc44d5092
msgid "Ensure the other checkboxes are as shown below"
msgstr "确保其他复选框如下图所示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:35
#: d7cca05c52e84726b991e1eb35cc5172
msgid "Push the green GO button on the bottom left"
msgstr "点击左下角绿色 GO 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ublox-firmware-update.rst:36
#: 949b7652bc8e4175b2c2bb979f4a00ae
msgid ""
"\"Firmware Update SUCCESS\" should be displayed if the update was successful"
msgstr "更新成功后应显示「Firmware Update SUCCESS」"
